{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.992,"lines":[{"text":"J’ai grandi là où l’air pèse","t":28.12,"e":29.34,"w":[["J’ai",28.12,28.26],["grandi",28.28,28.54],["là",28.58,28.7],["où",28.74,28.84],["l’air",28.86,29.06],["pèse",29.16,29.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Où le respect se gagne à la pièce","t":29.76,"e":31.1,"w":[["Où",29.76,29.84],["le",29.86,29.96],["respect",30.02,30.26],["se",30.3,30.4],["gagne",30.44,30.62],["à",30.68,30.68],["la",30.72,30.8],["pièce",30.88,31.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les faux sourires, je les vois d’loin","t":31.6,"e":32.76,"w":[["Les",31.6,31.68],["faux",31.72,31.84],["sourires",31.88,32.14],["je",32.2,32.26],["les",32.3,32.4],["vois",32.42,32.54],["d’loin",32.62,32.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans leurs yeux, j’lis la faim, pas le soin","t":33.02,"e":34.5,"w":[["Dans",33.02,33.14],["leurs",33.3,33.44],["yeux",33.46,33.56],["j’lis",33.6,33.7],["la",33.74,33.82],["faim",33.93,34.13],["pas",34.04,34.12],["le",34.16,34.24],["soin",34.3,34.5]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"On m’a vendu des promesses creuses","t":34.92,"e":36.22,"w":[["On",34.92,34.98],["m’a",35.02,35.12],["vendu",35.18,35.42],["des",35.46,35.56],["promesses",35.62,35.98],["creuses",36.02,36.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai gardé mes mains, pas leurs envies douteuses","t":36.32,"e":38.02,"w":[["J’ai",36.32,36.42],["gardé",36.46,36.7],["mes",36.74,36.86],["mains",36.9,37.02],["pas",37.06,37.14],["leurs",37.18,37.34],["envies",37.36,37.56],["douteuses",37.6,38.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai des frères qui marchent sans bruit","t":38.46,"e":39.68,"w":[["J’ai",38.46,38.56],["des",38.6,38.7],["frères",38.74,38.88],["qui",38.9,39],["marchent",39.06,39.24],["sans",39.3,39.44],["bruit",39.48,39.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le cœur blindé, l’esprit en sursis","t":39.76,"e":41.36,"w":[["Le",39.76,39.84],["cœur",39.9,40.04],["blindé",40.08,40.42],["l’esprit",40.48,40.74],["en",40.78,40.86],["sursis",40.92,41.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les murs ont tout vu, rien dit","t":41.48,"e":42.78,"w":[["Les",41.48,41.56]